{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control geometric shapes made of 4 small blocks, dropping, moving, and rotating them in a 10\u00d710\u00d710 cube grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform blocks at the right moment to fit different structures, clearing rows horizontally or vertically and aiming for high scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block shapes follow three spatial rules\u2014aligned along X, Y, or Z axis\u2014offering challenges in different dimensions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative 3D Tetris gameplay, breaking the limits of 2D planes with layered, stacked blocks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keyboard control for block movement and rotation, enabling precise high-score strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the scene 360\u00b0 or switch to top-down and bottom-up views to plan the perfect landing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse levels and difficulty modes suitable for casual players and puzzle enthusiasts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level 1</strong>: Clear a set number of blocks within the time limit!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level 2</strong>: Clear specified blocks under time pressure, testing both speed and accuracy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level 3</strong>: Drop a block and achieve consecutive clears within the time limit, maximum tension guaranteed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level 4</strong>: Enter the red shadow zone and clear more than the target number of blocks before time runs out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level 5</strong>: Place blocks precisely on all gray zones for the ultimate spatial challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level 6</strong>: Complete multiple clears on the designated layer, with difficulty stacking up level by level!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level 7</strong>: Clear multiple blocks in the shadow area, with block positions changing each time, blending randomness and strategy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3002\u3002\u3002\u3002\u3002</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beta Test Invitation:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to experience a brand-new 3D Tetris challenge? Join our beta test, help us fine-tune the levels, and see how far you can get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687010/extras/54b75286d88e7d3379f1ea429e1ecb07.poster.avif?t=1758909637\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687010/extras/54b75286d88e7d3379f1ea429e1ecb07.webm?t=1758909637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687010/extras/54b75286d88e7d3379f1ea429e1ecb07.mp4?t=1758909637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687010/extras/e0a32b1c7b1aeb39bb0f8f1793d40b2e.poster.avif?t=1758909637\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687010/extras/e0a32b1c7b1aeb39bb0f8f1793d40b2e.webm?t=1758909637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687010/extras/e0a32b1c7b1aeb39bb0f8f1793d40b2e.mp4?t=1758909637\" type=\"vide